{"availability":"available","full":"sholdee/crd-schema-publisher","name":"crd-schema-publisher","description":"Browsable CRD docs and IDE validation schemas, straight from your Kubernetes cluster","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":30,"forks":4,"created":"2026-04-09T04:01:09Z","updated":"2026-10-16T12:10:46Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sholdee.github.io/crd-schema-publisher/","topics":["cloudflare-pages","custom-resource-definitions","helm-chart","json-schema","kubeconform","kubernetes","kubernetes-controller"],"demo":"https://kube-schemas.shold.io/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T07:10:21.248Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T07:10:21.248Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T07:10:21.248Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:28.294Z","stars":30,"forks":4},{"at":"2026-10-17T07:10:21.248Z","stars":30,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["CRD docs and IDE validation, straight from the cluster.","Extracts CRD schemas from Kubernetes or YAML, converts Kubernetes built-in resource schemas from /openapi/v2, and publishes a searchable documentation site with interactive schema pages.","Static CRD catalogs go stale, miss internal CRDs, and depend on external infrastructure. crd-schema-publisher publishes schemas from your own cluster and can serve or sync them wherever you host static files."],"features":["Always accurate for installed CRDs, internal CRDs, and optional Kubernetes built-ins.","Self-hosted output for Cloudflare Pages, local serving, S3-compatible storage, git, or any static web server.","Single static binary in a distroless nonroot container.","Controller-grade watch mode with informers, leader election, debounced refreshes, health probes, and metrics."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sholdee/crd-schema-publisher/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"686d006cb81b850824df594688dc759d4f7cd1cbed58bfcf6eaa34bd18205a36","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26: